侯阿代侯。二十八年卒，子彊代侯","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"按原文明示親屬保存，不由繼侯推父子，不補同母、排行數字或闕代。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji109-003","subject_person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh_AA","predicate":"grandfather","object_person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p006","quote":"頃之，家居數歳。廣家與故潁陰侯孫屏野居藍田南山中射獵。嘗夜從一騎出，從人田間飲。還至霸陵亭，霸陵尉醉，呵止廣。廣騎曰：「故李將軍。」尉曰：「今將軍尚不得夜行，何乃故也！」止廣宿亭下。居無何，匈奴入殺遼西太守，敗韓將軍，後韓將軍徙右北平。於是天子乃召拜廣爲右北平太守。廣即請霸陵尉與俱，至軍而斬之。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"故潁陰侯孫","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存侯孫祖孫陳述；侯與孫未補姓名，屏字斷讀未定，不補中間父親或以外部記憶接系。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang","source_id":"s-shiji-095-fankuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p033","quote":"三歲，絳侯勃免相就國，嬰為丞相，罷太尉官。是歲，匈奴大入北地、上郡，令丞相嬰將騎八萬五千往擊匈奴。匈奴去，濟北王反，詔乃罷嬰之兵。後歲餘，嬰以丞相卒，謚曰懿侯。子平侯阿代侯。二十八年卒，子彊代侯。十三年，彊有罪，絕二歲。元光三年，天子封灌嬰孫賢為臨汝侯，續灌氏後，八歲，坐行賕有罪，國除。","source_term":"子平侯阿代侯。二十八年卒，子彊代侯"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji095-017","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh_A","person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh_AA"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m033-0094","start":94,"end":95,"surface":"彊","kind":"person","person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m033-0102","start":102,"end":103,"surface":"彊","kind":"person","person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p033","chapter_id"